     ccssiioo__ddeeccooddee() is used to decode information from the data in phase of the
     SCSI transfer.

     The decoding is similar to the command specifier processing of
     ccssiioo__bbuuiilldd() except that the data is extracted from the data pointed to
     by _c_s_i_o_-_>_d_a_t_a___p_t_r.  The stdarg list should be pointers to integers in‐
