     Kenneth Merry <_k_e_n_@_F_r_e_e_B_S_D_._o_r_g> implemented the CAM versions of these en‐
     coding and decoding functions.  This current work is based upon earlier
     work by Peter Dufault <_d_u_f_a_u_l_t_@_h_d_a_._c_o_m>.

